# Mesa 26.2.5 RTASM process-lifetime executable-code arena.
# Exact origin: rtasm_execmem.c:init_heap -> u_mm.c:u_mmInit; two 56-byte nodes.
# See docs/verification/M3_SANITIZER_DIAGNOSIS.md for stack/Build ID/reproducer.
# Only this native allocator path is eligible; never suppress calloc, unknown
# modules, all of libvulkan/LLVM, or an engine function.
# Stripped/unloaded frames cannot match a function rule. The opt-in local test
# preset retains driver libraries using the supported Vulkan loader switch.
# On this build retention alone keeps the arena reachable; no suppression is
# consumed. Keep this distinction when interpreting the successful run.
leak:rtasm_exec_malloc
